# Cyber Kill Chain

## Objective

Understand the stages followed by attackers during a cyber attack.

## Stages

1. Reconnaissance
2. Weaponization
3. Delivery
4. Exploitation
5. Installation
6. Command and Control
7. Actions on Objectives

## Why it Matters

Knowing each phase helps defenders detect and stop attacks before they reach their final objective.

## Skills Learned

- Attack lifecycle
- Threat detection
- Defensive thinking

## Summary

The Cyber Kill Chain provides defenders with a structured model to understand where security controls can interrupt an attack.
